  "details": "Much like how the mobile launcher allows you to load into a world without first loading into your home world (or the game for that matter) I want to be able to click on something from the quest home and  start loading into a group lobby within 10 seconds. Not launch vrchat, wait a minute before home loads, then click a billion times to find the group lobby, then wait another minute to load into the group lobby. \n\nI want to join semi-persistent lobbies as easily as I can call a small group of friends on discord. I want to see something like the native vrchat UI for Android on the quest and maybe even the PC. A VRChat launcher if you will. Load into that, find a group lobby or maybe even create a lobby for your and your friends right there in the launcher that certain friends get notified to join. Like creating a discord group and calling everyone, or creating a steam invite link. \n\nNaturally I want this feature on all platforms. The easiest to probably implement on first is mobile since it has the native UI which loads practically instantly compared to the full 3d environment",
